---
// src/components/sections/Engagement.astro
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-brand-dark relative border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
            <h2 class="font-heading text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-brand-glow uppercase mb-3">Partnership</h2>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
                Flexible <span class="text-brand-accent">Engagement Models.</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">We offer transparent, scalable models designed to fit the exact operational needs of startups and enterprise corporations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <div class="p-10 rounded-[2rem] bg-[#0a0f1d] border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-accent/30 transition-colors duration-500 shadow-xl group">
                <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Project-Based</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">Best for well-defined scopes. We handle end-to-end delivery from design to deployment on a fixed timeline.</p>
                <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300 font-medium">
                    <li class="flex items-center"><span class="text-brand-accent mr-3">✓</span> Fixed Budget</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center"><span class="text-brand-accent mr-3">✓</span> Defined Milestones</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center"><span class="text-brand-accent mr-3">✓</span> Full Team Assigned</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="p-10 rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0f172a] to-[#0a0f1d] border border-brand-accent/30 hover:border-brand-accent transition-colors duration-500 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(34,211,238,0.1)] relative group">
                <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-brand-accent text-[#0a0f1d] text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full tracking-wide uppercase">Most Popular</div>
                
                <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-accent flex items-center justify-center text-[#0a0f1d] mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Dedicated Team</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">We provide a specialized, autonomous engineering squad that works exclusively on your product roadmap.</p>
                <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300 font-medium">
                    <li class="flex items-center"><span class="text-brand-accent mr-3">✓</span> Scalable Resources</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center"><span class="text-brand-accent mr-3">✓</span> Direct Communication</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center"><span class="text-brand-accent mr-3">✓</span> Long-term Focus</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="p-10 rounded-[2rem] bg-[#0a0f1d] border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-accent/30 transition-colors duration-500 shadow-xl group">
                <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Staff Augmentation</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">Need to scale fast? Seamlessly integrate our senior React and Python developers into your existing internal team.</p>
                <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300 font-medium">
                    <li class="flex items-center"><span class="text-brand-accent mr-3">✓</span> Fill Skill Gaps</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center"><span class="text-brand-accent mr-3">✓</span> Complete Control</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center"><span class="text-brand-accent mr-3">✓</span> Rapid Onboarding</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>